Giving back to the Kulamalu Cowboys 10-year-old team means a lot to me because that’s where it all started for me. Growing up in Maui and playing for Kulamalu Cowboys and being part of that program taught me discipline, teamwork, and the value of community—lessons that have stayed with me throughout my journey. Now, having the chance to return and support the next generation of young athletes feels like coming full circle. Whether it’s helping out at practice, sponsoring uniforms, or just showing up to cheer them on, it’s an honor to give back to the program and place that helped shape who I am today. Mahalo 💯🤙 #onwisconsin 
